# Party 1 inputs: a_0, a_1 (wires 0, 1)
# Party 2 inputs: b_0, b_1 (wires 2, 3)
# Output: wire 4
#
# Compare with inner_product_2.arith which uses 2 MUL + 1 ADD gates

